-- Each product's real nutrition table, read from the photos of its label, and
-- that label cropped as the last picture of its gallery. Citrulline is not here:
-- its label has not been supplied, so it keeps what it has.
--
-- Run this AFTER the commit that adds public/images/store/nutrition/ has finished
-- deploying, or the gallery will point at files that are not there yet. It needs
-- 2026-11-10-store-flavor-images.sql to have run first.
--
-- The product's other pictures are kept, in their order, so anything changed from
-- the panel survives. Matches src/lib/store/seed.ts. Re-running it is harmless.

BEGIN;

